sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Client
  participant UI as React UI
  participant API as Express API
  participant SC as LocalBank
  participant EL as Event Listener
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor A as LB Admin

  rect rgb(234, 241, 251)
  note over C,DB: Installment payment
  C->>UI: pay installment (n)
  UI->>SC: payInstallment(loanId, n) [wallet signs]
  SC->>SC: record payment, advance schedule
  SC-->>EL: InstallmentPaid event
  EL->>DB: update INSTALLMENT, TRANSACTION
  EL->>API: recompute borrowing limit
  API-->>C: receipt
  end

  rect rgb(242, 244, 247)
  note over C,A: Income verification (KYC Level 2/3)
  C->>UI: upload income proof
  UI->>API: POST /income-proof
  API->>DB: store INCOME_PROOF (document hash)
  API->>A: queue for human review
  A->>API: verify / reject
  API->>DB: update KYC level
  API-->>C: KYC level updated
  end
